
Testing NamingConvention for Multivariate Simulations
=====================================================

Test 1: Non-conditional multivariate (nvar=2, nsim=2, simu-first)
Variable names: Test1.V1.S1, Test1.V1.S2, Test1.V2.S1, Test1.V2.S2

Test 2: Conditional multivariate (nvar=2, nsim=2, simu-first)
Variable names: Test2.Fe.S1, Test2.Fe.S2, Test2.Al.S1, Test2.Al.S2

Test 3: Non-conditional (nvar=2, nsim=2, variable-first)
Variable names: Test3.V1.S1, Test3.V2.S1, Test3.V1.S2, Test3.V2.S2

Test 4: Single simulation (nvar=2, nsim=1)
Variable names: Test4.V1.S1, Test4.V2.S1

Test 5: Larger case (nvar=3, nsim=3, simu-first)
Variable names:
  [ 0] Test5.Cu.S1
  [ 1] Test5.Cu.S2
  [ 2] Test5.Cu.S3
  [ 3] Test5.Pb.S1
  [ 4] Test5.Pb.S2
  [ 5] Test5.Pb.S3
  [ 6] Test5.Zn.S1
  [ 7] Test5.Zn.S2
  [ 8] Test5.Zn.S3
